  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/337cba09b098a129c60c88ca431dc00f7470bb1b39c1452e8d81688a7d6b6b0e.png] \n\nLet's check each option:\n\n1. **+, ×, ÷, –, =**\n\nGiven equation: 25 * 5 * 8 * 4 * 15 * 20\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n25 + 5 × __**8 ÷ 4**__ - 15 = 20\n\n25 + __**5 **____**× 2**__ - 15 = 20\n\n25 + 10 - 15 = 20\n\n**20 = 20**\n\n2. ÷, –, ×, +, =\n\nGiven equation: 25 * 5 * 8 * 4 * 15 * 20\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n__**25 ÷ 5**__ - 8 × 4 + 15 = 20\n\n5 - __**8 × 4**__ + 15 = 20\n\n5 - 32 + 15 = 20\n\n-12 ≠ 20\n\n3. +, ×, –, ÷, =\n\nGiven equation: 25 * 5 * 8 * 4 * 15 * 20\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n25 + 5 × 8 - __**4 ÷ 15**__ = 20\n\n25 + __**5 × 8**__ - 0.267 = 20\n\n25 + 40 - 0.267 = 20\n\n64.733 ≠ 20\n\n4. –, ÷, +, ×, =\n\nGiven equation: 25 * 5 * 8 * 4 * 15 * 20\n\nAfter interchanging the signs, we get:\n\n25 - __**5 ÷ 8**__ + 4 × 15 = 20\n\n25 - 0.625 + __**4 × 15**__ = 20\n\n25 - 0.625 + 60 = 20\n\n84.375 ≠ 20\n\nHence, ‘+, ×, ÷, –, =’ is the correct answer.",
